# Real HTTP 301 for the bare domain. Astro's static build also emits an
# index.html at "/", so the trailing "!" is required to make this rule win
# over that file. Without it Netlify serves the file and no redirect happens.
/                 /en/    301!

# To send Chinese-preference browsers to /zh/ instead, put this line ABOVE
# the rule above (first match wins):
#   /               /zh/    301!  Language=zh
